AI product manager"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":15,"item":{"@id":"https://getharsh.in/blog/figuring-things-out-one-book-at-a-time/#article","@type":"Article","url":"https://getharsh.in/blog/figuring-things-out-one-book-at-a-time/","identifier":"content:getharsh-figuring-things-out-one-book-at-a-time","name":"Figuring things out, one book at a time"}}]},"description":"Find pages, articles and collections from getHarsh.","text":"","url":"https://getharsh.in/search/","publisher":{"@id":"https://getharsh.in/#person","identifier":"person:harsh","@type":"Person","name":"Harsh Joshi","url":"https://getharsh.in/","sameAs":[{"@id":"https://github.com/getHarsh"},{"@id":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/getharsh/"}]},"author":[{"@id":"https://getharsh.in/#person"}]},{"@context":{"@version":1.1,"@vocab":"https://schema.org/","url":{"@id":"https://schema.org/url","@type":"@id"}},"@id":"https://getharsh.in/terms/","identifier":"content:getharsh-terms","@type":"WebPage","name":"Terms of use","creativeWorkStatus":"published","inLanguage":"en","usageInfo":{"@id":"https://getharsh.in/terms/"},"description":"Use and reuse of getHarsh and contact with the publisher.","text":"Terms of use\nHarsh Joshi publishes getHarsh as his personal writing and professional presence. RawThoughts Enterprises Private Limited operates the website and processes website data on his instructions. These terms concern your use of getharsh.in and every subdomain of it.\nReading and reusing material\nUnless a page states its own licence, getharsh.in is not openly licensed. You may read it, link to its pages and quote passages from it with attribution: name the author or publication and link to the page you quote. We permit that use, and it leaves untouched any wider right you have under fair dealing (section 52 of India's Copyright Act, 1957) or fair use elsewhere. The permission covers accurate quotation only; it does not cover misquoting the material or quoting it out of context so that it says something it does not. Reproducing the material without attribution, or presenting it as your own, is not permitted.\nTraining AI models on this material is not permitted, whether it is collected from this website, its subdomains or any other copy, and training crawlers are refused. Search engines and answer systems that link to the pages and cite them remain welcome; only training is refused. This reservation is also our opt-out from text and data mining wherever the law provides one. Each website and subdomain carries it in its robots.txt and a machine-readable reservation wherever its host lets us publish them; where a host does not, this page still applies. These terms do not withdraw permissions granted by a licence or change a third party's rights.\nFor other copying, adaptation or redistribution, follow the licence attached to the page, asset or source, or ask us or the rights holder named on the item. Attribution alone does not replace permission.\nAuthors, contributors and third parties retain the rights attributed to them. Quotations, translations, images and software do not acquire a common licence merely by appearing on this website. A software repository's licence governs that software, not all the prose or images published here.\nThe scope of the publication\nPersonal essays and accounts of past work express the author's experience and judgment. They are not individual professional advice. Mentioning an employer, collaborator or project does not represent an endorsement by that organisation.\nWe aim to keep the material accurate and correct errors brought to our attention. Sources, methods and circumstances can change; a dated account concerns the setting it describes. You remain responsible for assessing whether material is suitable for your circumstances and for seeking qualified advice where needed.\nResponsible use\nDo not use the website to infringe another person's rights, expose confidential information, impersonate someone, interfere with its operation or attempt unauthorised access.\nExternal websites and services have their own terms. A reference is not an assurance of their accuracy, security or continued availability.\nAvailability and responsibility\nThe publication is provided as information. We do not promise uninterrupted access or that every example will suit a particular purpose. To the extent permitted by applicable law, we make no warranty of fitness for your use and are not responsible for loss arising from reliance on the material or interruption of access. Nothing here excludes a responsibility or remedy that the law does not allow us to exclude.\nPrivacy and contact\nThe privacy notice explains the information handled by this publication's website and reading tools. A new use requiring consent will ask for it; continued reading is not agreement to that use.\nFor a correction, permission request or concern about these terms, write to info@getharsh.in. Please identify the page and the issue so we can respond.\nGoverning law\nIndian law governs these terms. Subject to mandatory law and any jurisdiction that cannot lawfully be excluded, disputes concerning use of the website fall within the jurisdiction of the competent courts in Lucknow. These terms do not replace a separate contract, licence or statutory right.\n","url":"https://getharsh.in/terms/","publisher":{"@id":"https://getharsh.in/#person","identifier":"person:harsh","@type":"Person","name":"Harsh Joshi","url":"https://getharsh.in/","sameAs":[{"@id":"https://github.com/getHarsh"},{"@id":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/getharsh/"}]},"author":[{"@id":"https://getharsh.in/#person"}]},{"@context":{"@version":1.1,"@vocab":"https://schema.org/","url":{"@id":"https://schema.org/url","@type":"@id"}},"@id":"https://getharsh.in/blog/oldest/","@type":"CollectionPage","author":[{"@id":"https://getharsh.in/#person"}],"creativeWorkStatus":"published","description":"Essays that stand on their own, from leadership and product work to comedy, forgiveness and the scale of a breath.","identifier":"content:getharsh-articles","inLanguage":"en","mainEntity":{"@type":"ItemList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","item":{"@id":"https://getharsh.in/blog/dumb-comedy/#article","@type":"Article","identifier":"content:getharsh-dumb-comedy","name":"Dumb comedy: existentialism for the twenty-first century","url":"https://getharsh.in/blog/dumb-comedy/"},"position":1},{"@type":"ListItem","item":{"@id":"https://getharsh.in/blog/what-a-decade/#article","@type":"Article","identifier":"content:getharsh-what-a-decade","name":"What a decade! Makes me wonder what is to come","url":"https://getharsh.in/blog/what-a-decade/"},"position":2},{"@type":"ListItem","item":{"@id":"https://getharsh.in/blog/debauchery-in-the-name-of-existence/#article","@type":"Article","identifier":"content:getharsh-debauchery-in-the-name-of-existence","name":"Debauchery, in the name of existence!","url":"https://getharsh.in/blog/debauchery-in-the-name-of-existence/"},"position":3},{"@type":"ListItem","item":{"@id":"https://getharsh.in/blog/the-future-we-create-and-condemn/#article","@type":"Article","identifier":"content:getharsh-the-future-we-create-and-condemn","name":"The future we create, and condemn","url":"https://getharsh.in/blog/the-future-we-create-and-condemn/"},"position":4},{"@type":"ListItem","item":{"@id":"https://getharsh.in/blog/figuring-things-out-one-book-at-a-time/#article","@type":"Article","identifier":"content:getharsh-figuring-things-out-one-book-at-a-time","name":"Figuring things out, one book at a time","url":"https://getharsh.in/blog/figuring-things-out-one-book-at-a-time/"},"position":5},{"@type":"ListItem","item":{"@id":"https://getharsh.in/blog/responsibility-is-not-a-title/#article","@type":"Article","identifier":"content:getharsh-responsibility-is-not-a-title","name":"Leading beyond the title","url":"https://getharsh.in/blog/responsibility-is-not-a-title/"},"position":6},{"@type":"ListItem","item":{"@id":"https://getharsh.in/blog/teachings-of